# Named Confederate units the order-of-battle matcher can't place (no state in the name, or several namesakes).
# Applied to Official Records and Wikipedia placements that have no unit code. pattern is a Python regex (case-sensitive),
# tried on the unit name as printed (no "|" in a pattern: one line per alternative); "not" lists
# words that must be absent, separated by ";".
# pattern|not|side|unit_code|note
\bWashington Artillery\b|Georgia;South Carolina;Tennessee|Confederate|CLAWASHBA|Washington Artillery of New Orleans (battalion; companies listed separately)
^Cobb['’]s Legion||Confederate|CGACOBBL|
^Phill?ip['’]?s['’]? (?:\(Georgia\) )?Legion||Confederate|CGAPHILL|
^Hampton(?:['’]s)? Legion||Confederate|CSCHAMPL|
^Holcombe Legion||Confederate|CSCHOLCL|
^Jeff\.? Davis (?:\(Mississippi\) )?Legion||Confederate|CMSJEFFLC|
^Palmetto (?:\(South Carolina\) )?Sharpshooters||Confederate|CSCPALMRS|
Mosby['’]s||Confederate|CVAMOSBRC|43rd Battalion Virginia Cavalry (Mosby's Rangers)
Robert G\.? Mosby||Confederate|CVAMOSBRC|the command listed under its commander
43r?d (?:Virginia )?Battalion||Confederate|CVAMOSBRC|
